;; bin/java-project test's module-info.java case: a Maven sources jar carrying a module-info.java at its root (as
;; bouncycastle's do; the jar made by the test from modinfo/lib, into a repository of its own), read by a dependent
;; module of sources that names java.desktop's java.awt.Point. On the class path the jar's module-info.java is left
;; out of its unpacked tree as of its file lists; kept on javac's source path, javac compiles in single-module mode
;; and the dependent fails "package java.awt is declared in module java.desktop, but module demo.modlib does not read it"
{:java {:release 25
        :modules [{:name "modlib" :artifact "org.example:modlib:1.0"}
                  {:name "modapp" :src ["$controls/modinfo/app"] :deps ["modlib"]}]}}
